---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Nav from '../components/layout/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/layout/Footer.astro';
---
<Base title="Now" description="What's running in the lab and what I'm thinking about right now.">
<style>
  .head { padding: 56px 0 0; max-width: 46rem; }
  .head p { color: var(--text-2); font-size: 1.05rem; margin-top: 8px; }
  .stamp { font-size: .82rem; color: var(--text-3); margin-top: 10px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .think { max-width: 46rem; margin-top: 40px; }
  .think p { color: var(--text-2); margin-top: 10px; }
  .think a { color: var(--amber); }
  .think a:hover { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .cols2 { margin-top: 44px; }
  .prow .stat { display: block; font-size: .88rem; color: var(--text-3); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; margin-top: 2px; }
</style>

<Nav variant="full" active="/now" />

<main class="wrapb">
  <div class="head">
    <h1 class="statement">Now</h1>
    <p>What's running, and what I'm thinking about. The numbers refresh nightly; the thinking refreshes when it changes.</p>
    <p class="stamp">Model data as of 2026-08-19 · page updated 2026-09-08</p>
  </div>

  <div class="think">
    <div class="sc">Thinking about</div>
    <p>Agentic identity. AI agents authenticate with borrowed credentials and leave audit trails that point at their humans. I'm building an intent-token layer on existing standards — RFC 8693 token exchange, SPIFFE workload identity — to attest not just <em>who</em> an agent is but <em>why</em> it's acting, working toward an open-source package and a paper. <a href="/writing/the-credential-remembers-who">The Credential Remembers Who</a> and <a href="/writing/the-workload-is-the-reasoning-session">The Workload Is the Reasoning Session</a> make the argument; <a href="/writing/retiring-vessel">Retiring Vessel</a> is the story behind it.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="cols2">
    <div>
      <div class="sc" style="display:block;margin-bottom:12px">Running</div>
      <!-- now:commonlist -->
      <a class="prow" href="https://commonlist.matterunknown.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="pt">Commonlist</span><span class="stat">contacts connected, cleaned, and merged across Google, Microsoft, Outlook, and iCloud</span></a>
      <!-- now:quant -->
      <a class="prow" href="/projects/quant-trading"><span class="pt">Quant scanner</span><span class="stat">100 symbols scanned daily · 8 positions open · paper trading</span></a>
      <!-- now:crypto -->
      <a class="prow" href="/projects/crypto-model"><span class="pt">Crypto model</span><span class="stat">21 assets scored daily · 0 buy signals</span></a>
      <!-- now:pokemon -->
      <a class="prow" href="/projects/pokemon-model"><span class="pt">Pokémon model</span><span class="stat">17,428 cards · 168 sets · top 25 updated daily</span></a>
      <!-- now:onepiece -->
      <a class="prow" href="/projects/onepiece-model"><span class="pt">One Piece model</span><span class="stat">1,035 cards · 43 sets</span></a>
      <!-- now:gpk -->
      <a class="prow" href="/projects/gpk-model"><span class="pt">Garbage Pail Kids model</span><span class="stat">11,580 cards tracked · 114 sets</span></a>
      <!-- now:building -->
      <span class="prow"><span class="pt">Building</span><span class="stat">agentic-id (intent tokens) · Harvest Haven (Roblox) · Perimeter OS</span></span>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="sc" style="display:block;margin-bottom:12px">Latest writing</div>
      <a class="wrow" href="/writing/retiring-vessel"><span class="wt">Retiring Vessel</span><span class="wd">Aug 2026</span></a>
      <a class="wrow" href="/writing/the-credential-remembers-who"><span class="wt">The Credential Remembers Who. Nothing Remembers Why.</span><span class="wd">Jul 2026</span></a>
      <a class="wrow" href="/writing/the-workload-is-the-reasoning-session"><span class="wt">The Workload Is the Reasoning Session</span><span class="wd">Jul 2026</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>

<Footer />
</Base>
